{"root":"tumbuk","ipa":"/ˈtumbʊk/","core":"用拳头击打，捣碎，研磨","pos":["动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ˈtumbʊk/","zh":"击打，捣碎","phrases":[{"t":"tumbuk lesung","zh":"用臼捣米"},{"t":"tumbuk muka","zh":"打脸"},{"t":"tumbuk lambung","zh":"撞击胃部，顶撞"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia menumbuk dinding karena marah.","zh":"他因为生气而捶打墙壁。"},{"t":"Ibu menumbuk bumbu di dapur.","zh":"母亲在厨房里捣碎香料。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"tumbuk","ipa":"/ˈtumbʊk/","zh":"击打，捣碎","phrase":{"t":"tumbuk batu","zh":"砸石头"},"example":{"t":"Jangan tumbuk meja itu.","zh":"不要拍打那张桌子。"}},{"w":"menumbuk","ipa":"/məˈnumbʊk/","zh":"捶打，捣碎，撞击","phrase":{"t":"menumbuk padi","zh":"舂米"},"example":{"t":"Petani itu sedang menumbuk padi di lumbung.","zh":"那个农民正在粮仓里舂米。"}},{"w":"ditumbuk","ipa":"/diˈtumbʊk/","zh":"被捶打，被捣碎","phrase":{"t":"ditumbuk halus","zh":"被捣细"},"example":{"t":"Bumbu itu ditumbuk sampai halus.","zh":"那种香料被捣得很细。"}},{"w":"penumbuk","ipa":"/pəˈnumbʊk/","zh":"捣锤，拳头","phrase":{"t":"penumbuk padi","zh":"舂米棒"},"example":{"t":"Dia menggunakan penumbuk kayu untuk menghaluskan rempah.","zh":"他用木质捣棒来研磨香料。"}},{"w":"tumbukan","ipa":"/tumˈbukan/","zh":"碰撞，冲击","phrase":{"t":"tumbukan keras","zh":"猛烈碰撞"},"example":{"t":"Tumbukan antara dua mobil itu sangat keras.","zh":"两辆车之间的碰撞非常剧烈。"}},{"w":"beretumbuk","ipa":"/bərətʊmˈbʊk/","zh":"互殴，打架","phrase":{"t":"beretumbuk di jalan","zh":"在路上打架"},"example":{"t":"Kedua anak itu beretumbuk karena berebut mainan.","zh":"那两个孩子因为争夺玩具而打架。"}},{"w":"bertumbuk","ipa":"/bərˈtumbʊk/","zh":"相撞，打斗","phrase":{"t":"bertumbuk pandang","zh":"目光交汇"},"example":{"t":"Perahu mereka bertumbuk di tengah sungai.","zh":"他们的船在河中央相撞了。"}}],"derSlugs":["tumbuk","menumbuk","ditumbuk","penumbuk","tumbukan","beretumbuk","bertumbuk"],"model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T17:01:57.449Z","src":"base"}